{"id":"question.physiology.cardiovascular.microcirculation-glycocalyx.001","kind":"original_concept_question","lessonId":"physiology.cardiovascular.microcirculation-glycocalyx","media":{"items":[{"columns":[{"id":"c0","label":"항목"},{"id":"c1","label":"값"}],"id":"question.physiology.cardiovascular.microcirculation-glycocalyx.001.media.question-table","rows":[{"cells":["Pc(mmHg)",25],"id":"r0"},{"cells":["Pi(mmHg)",0],"id":"r1"},{"cells":["πc(mmHg)",25],"id":"r2"},{"cells":["πi(mmHg)",5],"id":"r3"},{"cells":["σ",1],"id":"r4"},{"cells":["Kf",0.01],"id":"r5"}],"stage":"question","title":"고전 모형의 조건","type":"table"}],"schemaVersion":"1.0.0"},"options":[{"id":"A","text":"−0.05임의용적단위/분"},{"id":"B","text":"+0.05임의용적단위/분"},{"id":"C","text":"+0.25임의용적단위/분"},{"id":"D","text":"+0.45임의용적단위/분"},{"id":"E","text":"+5임의용적단위/분"}],"prompt":"고전적 여과 모형 Jv=Kf[(Pc−Pi)−σ(πc−πi)]에 표의 조건을 적용한다. 압력은 mmHg이고 Kf의 단위는 임의용적단위/(분·mmHg)다. 바깥쪽 여과를 양수로 정할 때 Jv는?","verificationStatus":"editorial_draft_not_exam_validated"}